# Source and fixtures are text, normalised to LF in the repository. Corpus
# programs and their golden outputs are compared byte for byte by the test
# suite, so a checkout that rewrote their line endings would fail the
# comparison for reasons that have nothing to do with the compiler.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.mc text eol=lf
*.expected text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
